sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant UI as MAXScript UI
  participant L as LicenseCore
  participant P as Provider
  U->>UI: enter key
  UI->>L: activate
  L->>P: validate + activate machine/seat
  P-->>L: signed/provider state
  L->>L: verify + normalize + cache
  L-->>UI: status/reason
